      "text": "ISF's Website said in a statement posted on its Facebook page, \"In the continuation of the Turkish attacks on our areas, the villages of Tal Tamr countryside were subjected to intense artillery shelling this morning, which resulted in the injury of 7 civilians, including children and the elderly.\"\n\nThe site added, \"These attacks are continuing due to the international silence and the lack of any deterrence by the guarantor powers in the region.\"\n\nThe website stressed, \"All this attacks will increase our people's insistence on struggle, and resistance.\"\n\nA.K\n\nANHA\n\nOther news\n\nArab and Turkish researchers: stripping Ocalan of his rights is a major violation of international law\n\n​​​​​​​ Turkish occupation targets a point for troops of Damascus government in Kharza\n\n​​​​​​​Turkish occupation shells Tawila, west of Tel Tamr"
